WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.771
&gt;&gt; GOOD AFTERNOON.
I'M HERE TODAY TO ANNOUNCE THE

00:00:04.771 --> 00:00:07.574
APPOINTMENT OF A SPECIAL COUNSEL
IN CONNECTION WITH TWO ONGOING

00:00:07.574 --> 00:00:11.211
CRIMINAL INVESTIGATIONS THAT
HAVE RECEIVED SIGNIFICANT PUBLIC

00:00:11.211 --> 00:00:14.614
ATTENTION.
THE FIRST, AS DESCRIBED IN COURT

00:00:14.614 --> 00:00:17.650
FILINGS IN THE DISTRICT OF
COLUMBIA, IS THE INVESTIGATION

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:23.056
INTO WHETHER ANY PERSON OR
ENTITY UNLAWFULFULLY INTERFERED

00:00:23.056 --> 00:00:27.360
WITH THE TRANSFER OF POWER
FOLLOWING THE 2020 PRESIDENTIAL

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:31.030
ELECTION OR THE CERTIFICATION OF
THE ELECTORAL COLLEGE VOTE HELD

00:00:31.030 --> 00:00:35.802
ON OR ABOUT JANUARY 6, 2021.
THE SECOND IS THE ONGOING

00:00:35.802 --> 00:00:39.939
INVESTIGATION INVOLVING
CLASSIFIED DOCUMENTS AND OTHER

00:00:39.939 --> 00:00:43.442
PRESIDENTIAL RECORDS AS WELL AS
THE POSSIBLE OBSTRUCTION OF THAT

00:00:43.442 --> 00:00:47.046
INVESTIGATION, REFERENCED AND
DESCRIBED IN COURT FILINGS IN A

00:00:47.046 --> 00:00:50.150
PENDING MANNER IN THE SOUTHERN
DISTRICT OF FLORIDA.

00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:54.521
I'M JOINED TODAY BY DEPUTY
ATTORNEY GENERAL LISA MONACO,

00:00:54.521 --> 00:01:00.894
U.S. ATTORNEY FOR THE DISTRICT
OF COLUMBIA, MATTHEW GRAVES, AND

00:01:00.894 --> 00:01:06.799
ASSISTANT ATTORNEY GENERAL FOR
THE CRIMINAL DIVISION.

00:01:06.799 --> 00:01:09.802
MATTHEW OLSON COULD NOT BE HERE.
HE IS CURRENTLY IN GERMANY

00:01:09.802 --> 00:01:13.740
REPRESENTING THE DEPARTMENT AT
THE G7 HOME AFFAIRS AND SECURITY

00:01:13.740 --> 00:01:15.742
MINISTERIAL.
U.S. ATTORNEY GRAVES HAS BEEN

00:01:15.742 --> 00:01:19.612
ABLY LEADING THE INVESTIGATIONS
INTO THE EVENTS LEADING UP TO

00:01:19.612 --> 00:01:23.082
AND ON JANUARY 6.
HE AND DOZENS OF ASSISTANT U.S.

00:01:23.082 --> 00:01:27.520
ATTORNEYS AND OTHER PROSECUTORS
HAVE TAKEN ON THE MONUMENTAL

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:34.194
TASK OF CONDUCTING OVER 900
PROSECUTIONS IN DEFENSE OF OUR

00:01:34.194 --> 00:01:36.729
DEMOCRATIC INSTITUTIONS.
CRIMINAL DIVISION PROSECUTORS

00:01:36.729 --> 00:01:42.202
UNDER THE ABLE LEADERSHIP OF
ASSISTANT ATTORNEY GENERAL --

00:01:42.202 --> 00:01:49.108
HAVE PLAYED A SIGNIFICANT ROLE
IN THOSE PROSECUTIONS.

00:01:49.108 --> 00:01:56.816
ASSISTANT ATTORNEY GENERAL OLSON
HAS BEEN ABLY LEADING THE

00:01:56.816 --> 00:01:58.417
INVESTIGATION.
ALL OF THE CAREER PROSECUTORS

00:01:58.417 --> 00:02:00.853
ASSIGNED TO THESE MATTERS ARE
CONDUCTING THEIR WORK IN THE

00:02:00.853 --> 00:02:04.591
BEST TRADITIONS OF THE
DEPARTMENT OF JUSTICE.

00:02:04.591 --> 00:02:07.961
I ALSO WANT TO RECOGNIZE THE
EFFORTS OF THE MANY FBI AGENTS

00:02:07.961 --> 00:02:10.563
AND OTHER LAW ENFORCEMENT
PERSONNEL WHO ARE ASSIGNED TO

00:02:10.563 --> 00:02:14.200
THESE MATTERS.
THEY ARE WORKING COURAGEOUSLY

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:18.471
AND STEADFASTLY AND ARE SERVING
OUR NATION HONORABLY.

00:02:18.471 --> 00:02:23.743
I AM GRATEFUL TO THEM.
WE ALL ARE.

00:02:23.743 --> 00:02:26.612
THE DEPARTMENT OF JUSTICE HAS
LONG RECOGNIZED THAT IN CERTAIN

00:02:26.612 --> 00:02:29.816
EXTRAORDINARY CASES, IT IS IN
THE PUBLIC INTEREST TO APPOINT A

00:02:29.816 --> 00:02:33.552
SPECIAL PROSECUTOR TO
INDEPENDENTLY MANAGE AN

00:02:33.552 --> 00:02:37.757
INVESTIGATION AND PROSECUTION.
BASED ON RECENT DEVELOPMENTS,

00:02:37.757 --> 00:02:40.226
INCLUDING THE FORMER PRESIDENT'S
ANNOUNCEMENT THAT HE IS A

00:02:40.226 --> 00:02:46.399
CANDIDATE FOR PRESIDENT IN THE
NEXT ELECTION AND THE SITTING

00:02:46.399 --> 00:02:49.535
PRESIDENT'S STATED INTENTION TO
BE A CANDIDATE AS WELL, I HAVE

00:02:49.535 --> 00:02:53.306
CONCLUDED THAT IT IS IN THE
PUBLIC INTEREST TO APPOINT A

00:02:53.306 --> 00:02:55.708
SPECIAL COUNSEL.
SUCH AN APPOINTMENT UNDERSCORES

00:02:55.708 --> 00:03:01.514
THE DEPARTMENT'S COMMITMENT TO
BOTH INDEPENDENCE AND

00:03:01.514 --> 00:03:03.316
ACCOUNTABILITY IN PARTICULARLY
SENSITIVE MATTERS.

00:03:03.316 --> 00:03:07.687
IT ALSO ALLOWS PROSECUTORS AND
AGENTS TO CONTINUE THEIR WORK

00:03:07.687 --> 00:03:10.923
EXPEDITIOUSLY AND TO MAKE
DECISIONS INDISPUTABLY GUIDED

00:03:10.923 --> 00:03:17.030
ONLY BY THE FACTS AND THE LAW.
THE SPECIAL COUNSEL WILL CONDUCT

00:03:17.030 --> 00:03:20.033
PARTS OF THE FIRST INVESTIGATION
I JUST MENTIONED.

00:03:20.033 --> 00:03:23.870
THE INVESTIGATION INTO WHETHER
ANY PERSON OR ENTITY UNLAWFULLY

00:03:23.870 --> 00:03:29.642
INTERFERED WITH THE TRANSFER OF
POWER FOLLOWING THE 2020

00:03:29.642 --> 00:03:31.610
PRESIDENTIAL ELECTION OR WITH
THE CERTIFICATION OF ELECTORAL

00:03:31.610 --> 00:03:34.847
COLLEGE VOTE HELD ON OR ABOUT
JANUARY 6.

00:03:34.847 --> 00:03:38.217
THIS DOES NOT INCLUDE
PROSECUTIONS THAT ARE CURRENTLY

00:03:38.217 --> 00:03:40.953
PENDING IN THE DISTRICT OF
COLUMBIA OR FUTURE

00:03:40.953 --> 00:03:45.425
INVESTIGATIONS AND PROSECUTIONS
OF INDIVIDUALS FOR OFFENSES

00:03:45.425 --> 00:03:46.693
COMMITTED WHILE THEY WERE
PHYSICALLY PRESENT ON THE

00:03:46.693 --> 00:03:50.229
CAPITOL GROUNDS ON JANUARY 6.
THOSE INVESTIGATIONS AND

00:03:50.229 --> 00:03:53.466
PROSECUTIONS WILL REMAIN UNDER
THE AUTHORITY OF THE U.S.

00:03:53.466 --> 00:03:56.435
ATTORNEY FOR THE DISTRICT OF
COLUMBIA.

00:03:56.435 --> 00:03:59.572
THE SPECIAL COUNSEL WILL ALSO
CONDUCT THE INVESTIGATION

00:03:59.572 --> 00:04:04.010
INVOLVING CLASSIFIED DOCUMENTS
AND OTHER PRESIDENTIAL RECORDS

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:09.015
AS WELL AS THE POSSIBLE
OBSTRUCTION OF THAT

00:04:09.015 --> 00:04:11.684
INVESTIGATION.
TODAY, I SIGNED AN ORDER

00:04:11.684 --> 00:04:15.421
APPOINTING JACK SMITH TO SERVE
AS SPECIAL COUNSEL.

00:04:15.421 --> 00:04:18.658
THE ORDER AUTHORIZES HIM TO
CONTINUE THE ONGOING

00:04:18.658 --> 00:04:20.893
INVESTIGATION INTO BOTH OF THE
MATTERS THAT I HAVE JUST

00:04:20.893 --> 00:04:24.731
DESCRIBED AND TO PROSECUTE ANY
FEDERAL CRIMES THAT MAY ARISE

00:04:24.731 --> 00:04:30.103
FROM THOSE INVESTIGATIONS.
MR. SMITH IS A VETERAN CAREER

00:04:30.103 --> 00:04:31.604
PROSECUTOR.
HE BEGAN HIS PROSECUTORIAL

00:04:31.604 --> 00:04:36.642
CAREER IN 1994 AS AN ASSISTANT
DISTRICT ATTORNEY WITH THE NEW

00:04:36.642 --> 00:04:42.114
YORK COUNTY D.A.'S OFFICE.
IN 1999, HE BECAME AN ASSISTANT

00:04:42.114 --> 00:04:45.051
U.S. ATTORNEY FOR THE EASTERN
DISTRICT OF NEW YORK, WHERE OVER

00:04:45.051 --> 00:04:48.921
THE COURSE OF NINE YEARS, HE
PROSECUTED MATTERS RANGING FROM

00:04:48.921 --> 00:04:52.125
GANG MURDERS OF POLICE OFFICERS
TO CIVIL RIGHTS VIOLATIONS.

00:04:52.125 --> 00:04:56.996
FROM 2008 TO 2010, HE SERVED
WITH THE INTERNATIONAL CRIMINAL

00:04:56.996 --> 00:05:02.668
COURT, WHERE HE SUPERVISED WAR
CRIMES INVESTIGATIONS.

00:05:02.668 --> 00:05:04.570
IN 2010, MR. SMITH RETURNED TO
THE JUSTICE DEPARTMENT TO SERVE

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:09.542
AS CHIEF OF THE PUBLIC INTEGRITY
SEC

00:05:09.542 --> 00:05:12.978
SECTION, WHERE HE LEAD A TEAM OF
MORE THAN 30 PROSECUTORS WHO

00:05:12.978 --> 00:05:15.948
HANDLED PUBLIC CORRUPTION AND
ELECTION CRIMES CASES ACROSS THE

00:05:15.948 --> 00:05:19.786
UNITED STATES.
IN 2015, HE AGREED TO SERVE AS

00:05:19.786 --> 00:05:21.521
THE FIRST ASSISTANT U.S.
ATTORNEY FOR THE MIDDLE DISTRICT

00:05:21.521 --> 00:05:26.192
OF TENNESSEE, LATER BECOMING THE
ACTING UNITED STATES ATTORNEY.

00:05:26.192 --> 00:05:30.196
MOST RECENTLY, MR. SMITH SERVED
AS CHIEF PROSECUTOR FOR THE

00:05:30.196 --> 00:05:34.267
SPECIAL COURT IN THE HAGUE,
CHARGED WITH INVESTIGATING AND

00:05:34.267 --> 00:05:36.335
ADJUDICATING WAR CRIMES IN
KOSOVO.

00:05:36.335 --> 00:05:40.273
MR. SMITH WILL BEGIN HIS WORK AS
SPECIAL COUNSEL IMMEDIATELY AND

00:05:40.273 --> 00:05:43.509
WILL BE RETURNING TO THE UNITED
STATES FROM THE HAGUE.

00:05:43.509 --> 00:05:48.214
THROUGHOUT HIS CAREER, JACK
SMITH HAS BUILT A REPUTATION AS

00:05:48.214 --> 00:05:51.184
AN IMPARTIAL AND DETERMINED
PROSECUTOR, WHO LEADS TEAMS WITH

00:05:51.184 --> 00:05:56.489
ENERGY AND FOCUS TO FOLLOW THE
FACTS WHEREVER THEY LEAD.

00:05:56.489 --> 00:06:01.761
AS SPECIAL COUNSEL, WE WILL
EXERCISE INDEPENDENT

00:06:01.761 --> 00:06:03.563
PROSECUTORIAL JUDGMENT TO DECIDE
WHETHER CHARGES SHOULD BE

00:06:03.563 --> 00:06:04.797
BROUGHT.
ALTHOUGH THE SPECIAL COUNSEL

00:06:04.797 --> 00:06:08.835
WILL NOT BE SUBJECT TO THE
DAY-TO-DAY SUPERVISION OF ANY

00:06:08.835 --> 00:06:11.537
OFFICIAL OF THE DEPARTMENT, HE
MUST COMPLY WITH THE

00:06:11.537 --> 00:06:14.240
REGULATIONS, PROCEDURES, AND
POLICIES OF THE DEPARTMENT.

00:06:14.240 --> 00:06:18.211
I WILL ENSURE THAT THE SPECIAL
COUNSEL RECEIVES THE RESOURCES

00:06:18.211 --> 00:06:21.714
TO CONDUCT THIS WORK QUICKLY AND
COMPLETELY.

00:06:21.714 --> 00:06:24.817
GIVEN THE WORK TO DATE AND
MR. SMITH'S PROSECUTORIAL

00:06:24.817 --> 00:06:29.121
EXPERIENCE, I AM CONFIDENT THAT
THIS APPOINTMENT WILL NOT SLOW

00:06:29.121 --> 00:06:33.359
THE COMPLETION OF THESE
INVESTIGATIONS.

00:06:33.359 --> 00:06:38.764
MEN AND WOMEN WHO ARE PURSUING
THESE INVESTIGATIONS ARE U

00:06:38.764 --> 00:06:41.234
CONDUCTING THEMSELVES IN
ACCORDANCE WITH THE HIGHEST

00:06:41.234 --> 00:06:44.003
STANDARDS OF PROFESSIONALISM.
I COULD NOT BE PROUDER OF THEM.

00:06:44.003 --> 00:06:47.840
I STRONGLY BELIEVE THAT THE
NORMAL PROCESSES OF THIS

00:06:47.840 --> 00:06:51.244
DEPARTMENT CAN HANDLE ALL
INVESTIGATIONS WITH INTEGRITY,

00:06:51.244 --> 00:06:55.581
AND I ALSO BELIEVE THAT
APPOINTING A SPECIAL COUNSEL AT

00:06:55.581 --> 00:06:58.417
THIS TIME IS THE RIGHT THING TO
DO.

00:06:58.417 --> 00:07:02.288
THE EXTRAORDINARY CIRCUMSTANCES
PRESENTED HERE DEMAND IT.

00:07:02.288 --> 00:07:07.026
MR. SMITH IS THE RIGHT CHOICE TO
COMPLETE THESE MANNERS IN AN

00:07:07.026 --> 00:07:14.000
EVEN HANDED AND URGENT MANNER.
THANK YOU ALL.

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:15.568
&gt;&gt; OKAY.
WE'VE BEEN LISTENING THERE TO

00:07:15.568 --> 00:07:21.240
THE ATTORNEY GENERAL TALKING
ABOUT NAMING A SPECIAL COUNSEL

00:07:21.240 --> 00:07:24.810
TO INVESTIGATE IN TWO OF THE
INVESTIGATIONS INTO DONALD

00:07:24.810 --> 00:07:26.679
TRUMP.
WE JUST LEARNED IT IS JACK

00:07:26.679 --> 00:07:30.550
SMITH, WHO HAS A VERY IMPRESSIVE
BIOGRAPHY, EVERYTHING FROM

00:07:30.550 --> 00:07:33.219
PROSECUTOR HERE IN THE STATES TO
INVESTIGATING WAR CRIMES AT THE

00:07:33.219 --> 00:07:35.721
HAGUE.
&gt;&gt; YEAH, STARTING HIS PUBLIC

00:07:35.721 --> 00:07:38.190
SERVICE ALMOST 30 YEARS AGO
WORKING IN THE FEDERAL

00:07:38.190 --> 00:07:41.994
GOVERNMENT IN BOTH DEMOCRATIC OR
UNDER DEMOCRATIC AND REPUBLICAN

00:07:41.994 --> 00:07:43.229
ADMINISTRATIONS.
OF COURSE WE'LL LEARN MORE ABOUT

00:07:43.229 --> 00:07:47.033
JACK SMITH IN THE COMING HOURS.
LET'S GO BACK NOW TO OUR PANEL.

00:07:47.033 --> 00:07:52.905
&gt;&gt; WE HAVE EVAN.
WE HAVE JESSICA SCHNEIDER AND

00:07:52.905 --> 00:07:55.641
ELIE HONIG.
ELIE, YOUR THOUGHTS?

00:07:55.641 --> 00:07:59.445
&gt;&gt; SO, WHEN WE TALK ABOUT THE
CAREER NON-POLITICAL PROSECUTOR,

00:07:59.445 --> 00:08:02.481
JACK SMITH APPEARS TO BE THE
VERY MODEL OF THAT NOTION.

00:08:02.481 --> 00:08:07.620
HE HAS WORKED, AS YOU SAID, FOR
DECADES AS A STATE AND FEDERAL

00:08:07.620 --> 00:08:10.623
PROSECUTOR AND AS A WAR CRIMES
PROSECUTOR.

00:08:10.623 --> 00:08:13.259
THERE'S NO POLITICAL LEANING ONE
WAY OR THE OTHER.

00:08:13.259 --> 00:08:17.430
THIS IS REALLY WHAT THE JUSTICE
DEPARTMENT TYPICALLY -- THE VAST

00:08:17.430 --> 00:08:18.897
MAJORITY OF FEDERAL PROSECUTORS
AT THE JUSTICE DEPARTMENT ARE.

00:08:18.897 --> 00:08:22.568
THEY ARE NOT POLITICAL ACTORS.
THEY ARE NOT POLITICAL

00:08:22.568 --> 00:08:23.936
APPOINTEES.
THEY ARE PEOPLE WHO JUST COME IN

00:08:23.936 --> 00:08:27.106
AND DO THE JOB AND DO THE WORK.
AND JACK SMITH, BY ALL

00:08:27.106 --> 00:08:29.375
APPEARANCES, HAS DONE THAT FOR
MANY, MANY YEARS NOW.

00:08:29.375 --> 00:08:31.177
NOW, HE IS GOING TO HAVE THE
FIRST SAY.

00:08:31.177 --> 00:08:34.413
HE IS GOING TO HAVE TO GET UP TO
SPEED ON THIS INVESTIGATION.

00:08:34.413 --> 00:08:35.881
IT'S GOING TO TAKE HIM SOME
TIME.

00:08:35.881 --> 00:08:38.217
BUT IT IS A WELL-DEVELOPED
INVESTIGATION.

00:08:38.217 --> 00:08:39.619
HE'S NOT STARTING FROM SQUARE
ONE.

00:08:39.619 --> 00:08:43.556
AND HE WILL ULTIMATELY HAVE AT
LEAST THE INITIAL CALL ON, DO WE

00:08:43.556 --> 00:08:50.196
INDICT OR DO WE NOT?
HE WILL HAVE SOME LEVEL OF

00:08:50.196 --> 00:08:54.300
INDEPENDENCE, SIGNIFICANT
INDEPENDENCE, FROM MERRICK

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:57.036
GARLAND AND THE JUSTICE
DEPARTMENT, BUT ULTIMATELY

00:08:57.036 --> 00:09:00.172
MERRICK GARLAND WILL RETAIN THAT
POWER TO AGREE OR DISAGREE.

00:09:00.172 --> 00:09:04.577
IF HE DISAGREES TO OVERRIDE
WHATEVER RECOMMENDATION

00:09:04.577 --> 00:09:09.281
MR. SMITH OFFERS UP.
&gt;&gt; THE ATTORNEY GENERAL SAID

00:09:09.281 --> 00:09:12.585
THAT THE EXTRAORDINARY
CIRCUMSTANCES DEMANDED THIS, AND

00:09:12.585 --> 00:09:16.455
HE SAID THAT HE IDENTIFIED, AS A
CATALYST FOR THIS DECISION, THE

00:09:16.455 --> 00:09:21.594
ANNOUNCEMENT OR THE DECLARATION
OF FORMER PRESIDENT TRUMP AS A

00:09:21.594 --> 00:09:25.097
2024 CANDIDATE AND THE
INCLINATION FROM THE CURRENT

00:09:25.097 --> 00:09:27.599
PRESIDENT TO RUN FOR
RE-ELECTION.

00:09:27.599 --> 00:09:31.771
YOUR REACTION TO WHAT WE JUST
HEARD FROM AG GARLAND?

00:09:31.771 --> 00:09:35.307
&gt;&gt; YOU KNOW, VICTOR, THERE
REALLY ISN'T A ROADMAP FOR A

00:09:35.307 --> 00:09:37.476
CIRCUMSTANCE LIKE THIS BECAUSE
OF HOW REMARKABLE THE

00:09:37.476 --> 00:09:39.211
CIRCUMSTANCES ARE.
AS THE ATTORNEY GENERAL LAID

00:09:39.211 --> 00:09:42.281
OUT, YOU HAVE A FORMER PRESIDENT
BEING INVESTIGATED BY THE

00:09:42.281 --> 00:09:45.584
JUSTICE DEPARTMENT.
TO DO THIS BY THE BOOK, TO

00:09:45.584 --> 00:09:50.723
CONDUCT THESE INVESTIGATIONS IN
A WAY THAT THE TEXTBOOKS WOULD

00:09:50.723 --> 00:09:53.693
SAY TO DO IT, YES, THE ATTORNEY
GENERAL HAD TO APPOINT A SPECIAL

00:09:53.693 --> 00:09:57.229
COUNSEL HERE.
WHAT YOU HAVE TO DO IS TAKE OUT

00:09:57.229 --> 00:09:59.231
EVEN THE APPEARANCE OF
IMPROPRIETY.

00:09:59.231 --> 00:10:01.567
LOOK, WE ALL KNOW -- I WASN'T
BORN YESTERDAY.

00:10:01.567 --> 00:10:05.771
AND WITHIN HOURS, THE RECORD OF
JACK SMITH IS GOING TO BE PICKED

00:10:05.771 --> 00:10:09.175
APART, AND HE WILL PROBABLY BE
SEEN BY SOME OR CRITICIZED BY

00:10:09.175 --> 00:10:12.945
SOME AS BEING A PARTISAN
POLITICAL HACK OR TOOL.

00:10:12.945 --> 00:10:16.382
WE SAW THIS PLAY OUT WITH ROBERT
MUELLER SEVERAL YEARS AGO.

00:10:16.382 --> 00:10:21.387
THE SIMPLE FACT IS REMOVING IT
FROM THE CHAIN OF COMMAND TO

00:10:21.387 --> 00:10:25.124
SOME EXTENT, TO THE JUSTICE
DEPARTMENT, IS VERY VALUABLE.

00:10:25.124 --> 00:10:27.960
THE OTHER POINT I WOULD MAKE
HERE, THE ONE PERSON WHO WAS NOT

00:10:27.960 --> 00:10:30.496
THERE ON THE STAGE, AND THAT WAS
JACK SMITH.

00:10:30.496 --> 00:10:33.165
THAT WAS TO GIVE AT LEAST THE
SENSE OF CLARITY THAT THIS IS A

00:10:33.165 --> 00:10:35.968
SEPARATE INDIVIDUAL FROM OUTSIDE
THE JUSTICE DEPARTMENT WHO IS

00:10:35.968 --> 00:10:40.272
COMING TO TAKE THIS MATTER OVER.
AND IT'S ALMOST THE BEST OF ALL

00:10:40.272 --> 00:10:41.707
WORLDS.
AT LEAST IN THE JUSTICE

00:10:41.707 --> 00:10:44.844
DEPARTMENT'S PERSPECTIVE,
BECAUSE NUMBER ONE, AS HAS BEEN

00:10:44.844 --> 00:10:47.346
SAID, HE GETS ALL OF THE STAFF
THAT HAVE BEEN WORKING ON THIS

00:10:47.346 --> 00:10:49.515
FOR QUITE SOME TIME.
AND NUMBER TWO, A FUTURE

00:10:49.515 --> 00:10:54.253
PRESIDENT CANNOT REALLY FIRE A
SPECIAL COUNSEL EXCEPT SOME

00:10:54.253 --> 00:10:57.790
EXTRAORDINARY REASON TO DO SO,
LIKE HE LITERALLY SHOWS UP TO

00:10:57.790 --> 00:10:59.625
WORK DRUNK OR SOMETHING LIKE
THAT.

00:10:59.625 --> 00:11:02.461
THE ATTORNEY GENERAL DOESN'T
HAVE THE SAME LATITUDE HE WOULD

00:11:02.461 --> 00:11:04.697
WITH A SENIOR POLITICAL
APPOINTEE.

00:11:04.697 --> 00:11:07.166
I KNOW THERE ARE PEOPLE WHO
MIGHT CRITICIZE THIS DECISION,

00:11:07.166 --> 00:11:11.170
BUT IT HAD TO BE DONE REGARDLESS
OF WHAT THE PRESIDENT'S ACTIONS

00:11:11.170 --> 00:11:13.439
WERE PREVIOUSLY.

